WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
PAPA PASTA — Landlord Introduction Pack v2.
LEVEL UP YOUR HUNGER.

00:04.500 --> 00:13.000
A South African quick-service pasta concept built for the new generation.
White room grounded in black. 6,000 K light. Acid Lime sole neon.

00:13.000 --> 00:22.000
The Pasta Theatre: glass-fronted bronze-die extrusion in view of the mall walkway.
Extruded and dried in store, cooked from dried to order.

00:22.000 --> 00:31.000
Reference concept: approximately 40 m² (5.00 × 8.00 m), fitted to your unit.
Customer queue, collection and rear staff routes stay strictly separated.

00:31.000 --> 00:38.000
All-electric retail kit (induction preferred):
Three-phase 400 V power, hot-line extraction (L/s or m³/h), water, floor drainage and grease interceptor.

00:38.000 --> 00:42.500
Six landlord inputs: controlled drawings, 400 V supply, extraction duct route & fire confirmation,
water/drainage/grease points, signage rules, and trading/loading/fit-out terms.

00:42.500 --> 00:45.000
PAPA PASTA — LEVEL UP YOUR HUNGER.
